    // insert batch REGISTERED + contributions
    // return response
}
```

Ratio sum: req.contributions().stream().map(ratio).reduce(BigDecimal.ZERO, add).compareTo(new BigDecimal("100.00")) != 0 → 400. Also duplicate apiaryId in request → 400 (check via set).

ResidueTestService:

```java
@Transactional
public TestSubmissionResponse rapidTest(long batchId, RapidTestRequest req) {
    return idempotency.execute("RAPID_TEST", req.requestId(), new Payload(batchId, req), ..., () -> doRapid(batchId, req));
}
